<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-TALLINNA KAUBAMAJA 96 PROFIT 36.1 MLN KROONS.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-TALLINNA KAUBAMAJA 96 PROFIT 36.1 MLN KROONS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Department store Tallinna Kaubamaja said on Tuesday that its 1996 pre-tax profit was 36.1 million kroons compared to 1995's 33.1 million kroons.</p>
<p>Net profit was 28.8 million kroons compared to 28 million kroons for 1995, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>The department store's net turnover for 1996 was 494 million kroons against the previous year's 426.4 million kroons.</p>
<p>-- David Mardiste, Tallinn newsroom +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
